  "slug": "quick-change",
  "name": "quick-change",
  "label": "Quick",
  "source": "// A quicker line for a small change made in a session (flows.md FL4): checked,\n// reviewed by an independent session, and landed on the reviewer's approval,\n// with no question to a person. The same segments and the same ways back to\n// the session as `change`: a failed check, the reviewer's findings and a\n// rebase conflict come back to the session that made the change, it fixes them\n// in its own checkout, and the run freezes its change again and takes it\n// through Check and every stage after. What lands is the snapshot Review\n// approved, and Deploy sends and waits for the deploy that carries it, as in `change`.\n// Each way back runs at most three times.\n//\n//   cast flow run quick-change      # this session's own edits\ndigraph \"quick-change\" {\n  graph [kind=\"line\", label=\"Quick\", description=\"Check, review, land, deploy: for a small change, landed on the reviewer's approval with no person asked\", takes=\"task,branch\", goal=\"$task_title\", on_failure=stop]\n  rankdir=LR\n  start [shape=Mdiamond]\n  check  [flow=\"check\", slot=\"Prove the change does what it should\"]\n  review [flow=\"review\"]\n  ship   [flow=\"ship\", label=\"Land\"]\n  deploy [flow=\"deploy\"]\n  exit [shape=Msquare, label=\"Live\"]\n\n  fix_check [label=\"Fix check\", backend=subject, max_visits=3,\n    prompt=\"@change/fix_check.md\"]\n  fix_review [label=\"Address review\", backend=subject, max_visits=3,\n    prompt=\"@change/fix_review.md\"]\n  fix_conflict [label=\"Resolve conflict\", backend=subject, max_visits=3,\n    prompt=\"@change/fix_conflict.md\"]\n\n  unchecked [shape=Msquare, label=\"Not checked here\", machine=true, stop=\"$stop_reason\"]\n  rejected  [shape=Msquare, label=\"Rejected\", stop=\"The reviewer rejected the change. $review_note\"]\n  unshipped [shape=Msquare, label=\"Not shipped\", stop=\"$stop_reason\"]\n\n  start -> check\n  check -> review\n  check -> fix_check [condition=\"outcome = failure and check.exit != unjudged\", label=\"check failed\"]\n  check -> unchecked [condition=\"outcome = failure and check.exit = unjudged\", label=\"not checked here\"]\n  review -> ship\n  review -> fix_review [condition=\"outcome = failure and review.exit = changes\", label=\"changes asked\"]\n  review -> rejected   [condition=\"outcome = failure and review.exit = rejected\", label=\"rejected\"]\n  ship -> deploy -> exit\n  ship -> fix_conflict [condition=\"outcome = failure and ship.exit = conflict\", label=\"conflict\"]\n  ship -> unshipped    [condition=\"outcome = failure and ship.exit = unshipped\", label=\"not shipped\"]\n  fix_check -> check\n  fix_review -> check\n  fix_conflict -> check\n}\n",
